<urn:atm:triage:finding/FTQ-001>
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:closed true ;
  triage:closedAt "2026-07-27T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:correctionNote "quality-mgr (2026-07-27): QA-1 for PR #668 (fix/phase-ai-rbp-boundary-cleanup @ de438f19). .just/tests/test_peer_pair_smoke.py::test_teardown_never_deletes_runtime_without_matching_pid_marker now wraps the spawned process in try/finally: process.terminate() -> wait(timeout=5) -> fallback process.kill() + wait(timeout=5) on TimeoutExpired. Process reliably reaped on every run including assertion-failure paths. rust-qa-agent confirmed via a live run of the full test_peer_pair_smoke.py suite (43 passed) against the real repo. All 6 QA-1 reviewers independently confirmed. CI green 8/8 legs." .